              <div style="color:#CFC09A;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:18.8px;padding:5px 0;"><span style="color:#CFC09A;">Passage en bateau (long)</span><span style="font-family:'Cinzel',serif;color:#C09030;">150 000 PO</span></div>
